<h4 id=3D"message-synchronization-across-multiple-devices">Message synchron=
ization across multiple devices</h4>
<p>Many users have multiple devices. We will explain how to sync messages a=
cross multiple devices. Figure 13 shows an example of message synchronizati=
on.</p>
